DexSwapModule::constructor
├── when router is zero address
│   └── it should revert with DexSwapModule_ZeroRouter
├── when router has no code (EOA)
│   └── it should revert with DexSwapModule_RouterNotContract
├── when router has code but does not expose factory()
│   └── it should revert with DexSwapModule_RouterNotUniswap
├── when router swallows calls and returns empty data
│   └── it should revert with DexSwapModule_RouterNotUniswap
├── when router factory() returns an address with no code
│   └── it should revert with DexSwapModule_RouterNotUniswap
└── when router is a valid contract
    ├── it should set the immutable router address
    ├── it should store sequencerUptimeFeed as immutable
    ├── it should store sequencerGracePeriod as immutable
    └── it should return "SWAP" from moduleType()
